 "result_text": "I fixed `loadConfigFiles` in `nose2/session.py`, so `nose2 -c tox.ini --junit-xml ...` should work again. I haven't run it or the test suite.\n\nIn v0.15.0, `loadConfigFiles` only read files ending in `.cfg` as ini files. It only read `.toml` files if they were named `pyproject.toml`. A file like `tox.ini` was skipped, so its `[unittest] plugins` list never loaded and `--junit-xml` was unrecognized.\n\nNow any file ending in `.toml` is parsed as TOML. Every other filename is read as ini, as in v0.14.2. One side effect: a `.toml` file not named `pyproject.toml` is now parsed as TOML too, where before it was ignored.",
